  "在本机保存上述设置与登录令牌": {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "td",
    "pages": [
      "privacy.html"
    ]
  },
  "在你触发翻译时向当前页面注入所需脚本": {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "td",
    "pages": [
      "privacy.html"
    ]
  },
  "仅作用于你当前操作的那个标签页": {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "td",
    "pages": [
      "privacy.html"
    ]
  },
  "仅在你开启视频字幕翻译时，读取当前标签页的声音并在本机识别成文字": {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "td",
    "pages": [
      "privacy.html"
    ]
  },
  "访问 <code>api.openai.com</code>、<code>api.deepseek.com</code>、<code>api-free.deepl.com</code>、<code>api.deepl.com</code>": {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "td",
    "pages": [
      "privacy.html"
    ]
  },
  "自带 Key 时向你选定的平台发送翻译请求": {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "td",
    "pages": [
      "privacy.html"
    ]
  },
  "可选：访问你自己的接口域名": {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "td",
    "pages": [
      "privacy.html"
    ]
  },
  "仅当你填写了自定义接口地址（代理或中转）时申请，且只申请那一个域名；在点击「测试连接」时弹出授权，不会申请所有网站": {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "td",
    "pages": [
      "privacy.html"
    ]
  },
  "内容脚本匹配所有网站": {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "td",
    "pages": [
      "privacy.html"
    ]
  },
  "用户可能在任意网页选中文字或指定翻译区域；内容脚本提供翻译入口，仅过滤不含文字的选区": {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "td",
    "pages": [
      "privacy.html"
    ]
  },
  "联系方式": {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "h3",
    "pages": [
      "privacy.html"
    ]
  },
  "有任何疑问或数据请求，请发邮件到 <a class=\"link\" href=\"mailto:support@huaci.app\">support@huaci.app</a>， 或在 <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://github.com/csswork/AiTranslation/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub Issues</a> 提出。": {
    "kind": "text",
